			"notes": "### Updated to 1.21.1\nCarolina's Tweaks has now been fully updated to 1.21.1!\n\n### Breaking Change: Create now required!\nTo use Carolina's Tweaks, you are now required to install the Create mod. This is because the mod is primarily intended to pair well with Create.\n\nIn terms of mod development, the mod now also uses Create Datagen, to allow the creation of Create recipes in a more easier way.\n\n### Recipe change: The Factory Must Go On: Steel Plate (Create: sequenced assembly)\nIf you have both Ad Astra and TFMG installed, Ad Astra's steel plate can be used in place of the TFMG steel plate. As a result, the TFMG steel plate sequenced assembly recipe is disabled by this mod, as personally I found it quite annoying due to it overriding Ad Astra's Create-compatible recipe, making it harder to make steel plates for Ad Astra items.\n\nIf you do not have Ad Astra installed, the recipe will remain enabled.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carolinaisslaying/CarolinasTweaks/compare/1.3.6-stable+mc1.20.1...1.4.0-stable+mc1.21.1"
		},
