			"notes": "### New Create Recipes\n\n* **Redstone**: Super-heated mixing 1000mB of lava with one quartz, one glowstone and one cinder flour will produce two redstone.\n* **Copper Oxidisation**: Spouting any block within base Minecraft or Create that can be oxidised with water 500mB will oxidise it to the next level. Check JEI for further information.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carolinaisslaying/CarolinasTweaks/compare/1.3.5-stable+mc1.20.1...1.3.6-stable+mc1.20.1"
