			"notes": "### New Create: Mixing Recipes\n\n* **TFMG Concrete**: Super-heated mixing of 1,000 mB liquid concrete produces **1 TFMG concrete block**.\n* **TFMG Cinder Block**: Super-heated mixing of 1,000 mB liquid concrete with **6 cinder bricks** and **2 rebar** yields **8 TFMG cinder blocks**.\n* **Ad Astra Steel Ingot**: Super-heated mixing of **1 iron ingot** with **coal or charcoal** produces **1 steel ingot**.\n\n### Bugs\n* Fix version string allowing all 1.20.x versions, when this should only be 1.20.1."
